WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.480
Yes, it's true. There are extensive foreign ties,

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.520
and I think that would be a very valid step to take.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.320
Good. I think so, too.

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:05.960
Yes.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:08.000
Good. I think it's a good point.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.600
Thank you.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.080
On the shutdown, we are now about one week away

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.920
from military service members missing their paychecks.

00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:19.440
We'll always take care of our military.

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:23.200
Would you encourage Congress to pass a standalone bill

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.680
to pay our service members?

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.000
Yeah, that probably will happen.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.160
We don't have to worry about it yet.

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:28.320
That's a long time.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.320
You know what one week is for me?

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:32.279
An eternity.

00:00:32.279 --> 00:00:34.959
One week for me is a long time.

00:00:34.959 --> 00:00:35.759
We'll take care of it.

00:00:35.759 --> 00:00:38.959
Our military is always going to be taken care of.

00:00:38.959 --> 00:00:40.720
Yeah, please, blue dress, blue.

